name genealogy-profiles
category Package
revision 69580
shortdesc Genealogical profiles for LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc This package enables the presenstation of individual profiles,
longdesc which may be useful for genealogical or local history
longdesc treatises. Each profile is typeset using key/value-configurable
longdesc environments, and a number of macros are provided to enable
longdesc references and name formatting.
runfiles size=6
